  * Touch sensor → GPIO pin mapping:
  *   HEAD       PE7
  *   CHIN       PE8
  *   BELLY      PE9
  *   BACK       PE10
  *   TAIL       PE11
  *   PAW_LEFT   PE12
  *   PAW_RIGHT  PE13
  *   (PE14, PE15 reserved / spare)
  *
  * UART2 (115200 baud) — messages sent TO Jetson:
  *   Touch tap  : "TOUCH HEAD\r\n"       (on release after short press)
  *   Touch hold : "TOUCH HEAD HOLD\r\n"  (while held > HOLD_THRESH_MS)
  *                "TOUCH HEAD RELEASE\r\n" (on release after hold)
  *   IMU stream : "IMU ax ay az gx gy gz\r\n"  (every IMU_REPORT_MS)
  *
  * UART2 — commands received FROM Jetson:
  *   GO | FWD | BACK | LEFT | RIGHT | PIVOT_LEFT | PIVOT_RIGHT | STOP
  *
  * I2C bus assignment:
  *   I2C1 (PB6=SCL, PB9=SDA) → BMI323 IMU  (addr 0x68, SDO low)
  *   I2C3                     → PCA9685 servo driver
  ******************************************************************************
  */
